---
name: Naming Conventions
description: Naming conventions for types, files, database elements, tests, and namespaces.
alwaysApply: true
---

> For lookup by element type, invoke `/naming-conventions`. Project-specific root namespace: see `.agents/patterns/project-facts.md`.

## Files & Types

| Element | Pattern | Example |
|---------|---------|---------|
| **Entity** | `{Noun}` | `User.cs`, `Role.cs` |
| **Aggregate Root** | `{Noun}` | `User.cs` (inherits `AggregateRoot`) |
| **Value Object** | `{Noun}` | `Email.cs`, `Password.cs` |
| **Domain Event** | `{Noun}{PastVerb}Event` | `UserRegisteredEvent.cs` |
| **Repository Interface** | `I{AggregateRoot}Repository` | `IUserRepository.cs` |
| **Repository Impl** | `{AggregateRoot}Repository` | `UserRepository.cs` |
| **Command** | `{Verb}{Noun}Command` | `RegisterUserCommand.cs` |
| **Command Handler** | `{Verb}{Noun}CommandHandler` | `RegisterUserCommandHandler.cs` |
| **Query** | `{Get\|List}{Noun}Query` | `GetUserByIdQuery.cs`, `ListRolesQuery.cs` |
| **Query Handler** | `{Get\|List}{Noun}QueryHandler` | `GetUserByIdQueryHandler.cs` |
| **Validator** | `{CommandName}Validator` | `RegisterUserCommandValidator.cs` |
| **Output DTO** | `{Noun}Output` | `UserOutput.cs`, `RoleOutput.cs` |
| **Mapper** | `{Noun}Mapper` | `UserMapper.cs` |
| **Controller** | `{Module}Controller` | `IdentityController.cs` |
| **EF Configuration** | `{Entity}Configurations` | `UserConfigurations.cs` |
| **Seeder** | `{Entity}Seeder` | `RoleSeeder.cs` |
| **Middleware** | `{Purpose}Middleware` | `RequestLoggingMiddleware.cs` |
| **Configuration** | `{Feature}Configuration` | `SecurityConfiguration.cs` |
| **Test Class** | `{SystemUnderTest}Tests` | `RegisterUserCommandHandlerTests.cs` |

## Namespaces

Pattern: `{RootNamespace}.{Layer}.{Module}.{Folder}` — see `.agents/patterns/project-facts.md` for `{RootNamespace}`.

## Database

| Element | Convention | Example |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Table name | Plural PascalCase | `Users`, `Roles` |
| Column name | PascalCase | `FirstName`, `TenantId` |
| FK column | `{ReferencedEntity}Id` | `UserId`, `RoleId` |
| Index | Composite with `TenantId` | `{TenantId, Email}` |

## Test Methods

`{Method}_{Scenario}_{ExpectedBehavior}` — e.g. `Handle_ShouldCreateUser_WhenInputIsValid`.

## Permissions & Policies

- Policy names: PascalCase constants in `SecurityConfiguration`.
- Permission names: lowercase dot-separated (`users.read`, `billing.invoice.read`).
